          text: "**Searching for Langfuse info**\n\nI'm thinking about how we have an overview of the content already. It might be useful to search the docs overview page for more specific details. I’ll use the search functionality and query \"What can I use Langfuse for?\" to pull in relevant information. This should help me provide a clearer and more informative answer on how Langfuse can be used. Let's see what I can find!",
